                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "I came to a conclusion that the best approach here is to document that \"Browser\" item requires a said dependency. This should be already added on latest `main`.\r\n\r\nThere is now also a `sections.pick` for 'mini.pick' pickers.\r\n\r\nThanks again for raising this issue!",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I came to a conclusion that the best approach here is to document that \"Browser\" item requires a said dependency. This should be already added on latest <code class=\"notranslate\">main</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There is now also a <code class=\"notranslate\">sections.pick</code> for 'mini.pick' pickers.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks again for raising this issue!</p>",
